            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.  $ \\underline{Personal} $ - Grants of personal leave are discretionary with the Employer, must be approved by the Director of Personnel Services and are not subject to the grievance and arbitration provisions of this Agreement.",
